        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Horace Ové, A. Edward Sutherland, Zak Ové, Indra Ové, Sandy Howard\n- Roles: filmmaker, photographer, painter, writer, film director, actor, producer, actress\n- Works: Mack & Myer for Hire\n\nFacts:\n- Albert Edward Sutherland was born on January 5, 1895, and he was a film director and actor.\n- Horace Ové was born in 1939, and he is a British filmmaker, photographer, painter, and writer.\n- Horace Ové is one of the leading black independent filmmakers to emerge in Britain since the post-war period.\n- Albert Edward Sutherland died on December 31, 1973.\n- Zak Ové is the son of filmmaker Horace Ové and the brother of actress Indra Ové.\n- Mack & Myer for Hire was produced by Sandy Howard and directed by Edward Sutherland.",
